<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hartmarx reduced.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hartmarx reduced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said analyst Brenda Gall downgraded Hartmarx Corp to near-term neutral from accumulate and kept the long-term accumulate rating.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 5/8 to 8-7/8.</p>
</text>
